# Fights at Orerve again, from another random state, and meets the Plate and the Escape Pod drifting and a
# Sidewinder, which no other replay meets. It starts from combat-orerve-drifters.cdr (Tools/PrepareCommanders.py):
# the fighter (a military laser, ECM, an energy unit, 20 kills) with its random state 3,350,928 draws on. It finds
# Orerve on the short-range chart and jumps there. In space it holds J and full speed whenever no ship but a rock
# or a barrel is about: while the jump drive is engaged, ships of every class spawn 32 times as often
# (ScaleSpawnOdds) until a ship mass-locks the drive. The draw count was found by a search over counts for the run
# that meets the most ship types the rest of the corpus does not. The fight was played by a scratch program that
# steered at the nearest ship by its position each frame and fired when it was in the sights; what it pressed is
# recorded here like any other replay.
file JAMESON.CDR combat-orerve-drifters.cdr
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key Escape; wait 0.3               # the disc menu
key l; wait 0.3                    # Load Commander: it asks for a file name
key j; key a; key m; key e; key s; key o; key n; key Return; wait 0.5
digest loaded 6f9c6922c528fde0a295f7cedc2e90a7430dcfdc79152fb952a35c38ed7b0006
key F6; wait 0.5                   # the short-range chart: F finds a system by name
key f; wait 0.3; key o; key r; key e; key r; key v; key e; key Return; wait 0.3
key F1; wait 0.5                   # launch
down h; wait 1; up h               # the countdown to Orerve
wait 8
digest orerve b1751df02f36a99cf3c5d874d6a6d35c7b4a8d43d778880e5e051888b8e957a9
# The fight, as recorded: a step for each change of the keys, and the frames between.
down period; down j; wait 0.350
up period; wait 1.100
down Right; up j; wait 0.950
down Up; wait 0.200
down Left; up Right; wait 0.050
down space; wait 0.050
up Up; wait 0.050
down Down; up space; wait 0.200
up Down; wait 0.650
down Up; wait 0.200
up Left; down Right; wait 0.050
down space; wait 0.050
up Up; down Down; wait 0.050
up space; wait 0.150
down space; wait 0.050
up Down; wait 0.200
down Up; wait 0.250
up Right; up Up; up space; down j; wait 0.600
down Right; down Up; down space; up j; wait 0.100
up Up; wait 0.150
down Up; wait 0.150
up Right; up Up; up space; down j; wait 1.150
down Left; down Up; wait 0.250
up Left; wait 0.900
up j; wait 1.000
up Up
digest after-the-fight 979ebdba214dae0f90de3b86bf6231d77a5f0f2224075a2e0fda6b46fd1b57f4
